{"timestamp":"2026-07-25T05:58:25.498Z","type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"agent_message","message":"The invariant is: starting a loop with accumulator `A` and remaining sequence `VS`, fixed execution ends with accumulator `A + totalLen(VS)`. The base is the empty sequence; the step adds the current element’s semantic `len` and recurs on the tail. I’m encoding that as a circularity plus two entry claims (`<=` and `>`) so the tie-first behavior is explicit.","phase":"commentary","memory_citation":null}}
{"timestamp":"2026-07-25T05:58:25.498Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","id":"msg_03910549af0707ff016a64507fbe70819584b8ba9de5236156","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"output_text","text":"The invariant is: starting a loop with accumulator `A` and remaining sequence `VS`, fixed execution ends with accumulator `A + totalLen(VS)`. The base is the empty sequence; the step adds the current element’s semantic `len` and recurs on the tail. I’m encoding that as a circularity plus two entry claims (`<=` and `>`) so the tie-first behavior is explicit."}],"phase":"commentary","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"019f97d6-4dc8-7d83-aae7-cebf9da1b3c7"}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-07-25T05:58:53.587Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_03910549af0707ff016a6450817c088195bc627a03bf1fe7a1","status":"completed","call_id":"call_Z6CFXO0fXidmnP0SnumuhQer","name":"apply_patch","input":"*** Begin Patch\n*** Add File: /workspace/verification.k\n+requires \"reference-semantics/semantics.k\"\n+\n+module VERIFICATION\n+  imports MPY\n+\n+  // A mathematical summary of the supplied semantics' len result for every\n+  // element of a ValSeq.  The HumanEval claims instantiate elements as strings.\n+  syntax Int ::= totalLen(ValSeq) [function, total]\n+  rule totalLen(.ValSeq) => 0\n+  rule totalLen(vCons(V:Val, VS:ValSeq))\n+    => seqLen(V) +Int totalLen(VS)\n+endmodule\n*** Add File: /workspace/spec.k\n+requires \"verification.k\"\n+\n+module SPEC\n+  imports VERIFICATION\n+\n+  claim [sum-loop]:\n+    <k>\n+      #loop(\n+        list(VS:ValSeq),\n+        Name(\"string\"),\n+        AugAssign(Name(\"total\"), \"+\", Call(Name(\"len\"), Name(\"string\")))\n+      )\n+      => .K\n+      ...\n+    </k>\n+    <env> L:Int </env>\n+    <scopes>\n+      ...\n+      L |-> scope(\n+        \"total\" |-> (ACC:Int => ACC +Int totalLen(VS))\n+        \"string\" |-> (_OLD:Val => ?LAST:Val)\n+        REST:Map,\n+        P:Parent\n+      )\n+      ...\n+    </scopes>\n+    <scopeLoc> SL:Int </scopeLoc>\n+    <heap> HP:Map </heap>\n+    <heapLoc> HL:Int </heapLoc>\n+    <stack> STACK:List </stack>\n+    <ret> noRet </ret>\n+    <exc> NoExc </exc>\n+    <exit-code> 0 </exit-code>\n+\n+  claim [entry-first]:\n+    <k>\n+      #loadAll(Module(\n+        FuncDef(\"_total_length\", Params(\"strings\"),\n+          Assign(Name(\"total\"), Int(0))\n+          Assign(Name(\"string\"), NoneVal)\n+          For(Name(\"string\"), Name(\"strings\"),\n+            AugAssign(Name(\"total\"), \"+\", Call(Name(\"len\"), Name(\"string\"))))\n+          Return(Name(\"total\")))\n+        FuncDef(\"total_match\", Params(\"lst1\", \"lst2\"),\n+          If(Compare(\n+            Call(Name(\"_total_length\"), Name(\"lst1\")),\n+            CmpOp(\"<=\", Call(Name(\"_total_length\"), Name(\"lst2\")))),\n+            Return(Name(\"lst1\")),\n+            )\n+          Return(Name(\"lst2\")))\n+      ))\n+      ~> Call(Name(\"total_match\"), list(A:ValSeq), list(B:ValSeq))\n+      => list(A)\n+    </k>\n+    <env> 0 </env>\n+    <scopes>\n+      0 |-> scope(.Map, parent(-1))\n+      -1 |-> builtinsScope\n+      =>\n+      0 |-> scope(\n+        \"_total_length\" |-> closureVal(\n+          (\"strings\", .ParamNames),\n+          Assign(Name(\"total\"), Int(0))\n+          Assign(Name(\"string\"), NoneVal)\n+          For(Name(\"string\"), Name(\"strings\"),\n+            AugAssign(Name(\"total\"), \"+\", Call(Name(\"len\"), Name(\"string\"))))\n+          Return(Name(\"total\")),\n+          0\n+        )\n+        \"total_match\" |-> closureVal(\n+          (\"lst1\", \"lst2\", .ParamNames),\n+          If(Compare(\n+            Call(Name(\"_total_length\"), Name(\"lst1\")),\n+            CmpOp(\"<=\", Call(Name(\"_total_length\"), Name(\"lst2\")))),\n+            Return(Name(\"lst1\")),\n+            )\n+          Return(Name(\"lst2\")),\n+          0\n+        ),\n+        parent(-1)\n+      )\n+      -1 |-> builtinsScope\n+    </scopes>\n+    <scopeLoc> 1 </scopeLoc>\n+    <heap> .Map </heap>\n+    <heapLoc> 0 </heapLoc>\n+    <stack> .List </stack>\n+    <ret> noRet </ret>\n+    <exc> NoExc </exc>\n+    <exit-code> 0 </exit-code>\n+    requires totalLen(A) <=Int totalLen(B)\n+\n+  claim [entry-second]:\n+    <k>\n+      #loadAll(Module(\n+        FuncDef(\"_total_length\", Params(\"strings\"),\n+          Assign(Name(\"total\"), Int(0))\n+          Assign(Name(\"string\"), NoneVal)\n+          For(Name(\"string\"), Name(\"strings\"),\n+            AugAssign(Name(\"total\"), \"+\", Call(Name(\"len\"), Name(\"string\"))))\n+          Return(Name(\"total\")))\n+        FuncDef(\"total_match\", Params(\"lst1\", \"lst2\"),\n+          If(Compare(\n+            Call(Name(\"_total_length\"), Name(\"lst1\")),\n+            CmpOp(\"<=\", Call(Name(\"_total_length\"), Name(\"lst2\")))),\n+            Return(Name(\"lst1\")),\n+            )\n+          Return(Name(\"lst2\")))\n+      ))\n+      ~> Call(Name(\"total_match\"), list(A:ValSeq), list(B:ValSeq))\n+      => list(B)\n+    </k>\n+    <env> 0 </env>\n+    <scopes>\n+      0 |-> scope(.Map, parent(-1))\n+      -1 |-> builtinsScope\n+      =>\n+      0 |-> scope(\n+        \"_total_length\" |-> closureVal(\n+          (\"strings\", .ParamNames),\n+          Assign(Name(\"total\"), Int(0))\n+          Assign(Name(\"string\"), NoneVal)\n+          For(Name(\"string\"), Name(\"strings\"),\n+            AugAssign(Name(\"total\"), \"+\", Call(Name(\"len\"), Name(\"string\"))))\n+          Return(Name(\"total\")),\n+          0\n+        )\n+        \"total_match\" |-> closureVal(\n+          (\"lst1\", \"lst2\", .ParamNames),\n+          If(Compare(\n+            Call(Name(\"_total_length\"), Name(\"lst1\")),\n+            CmpOp(\"<=\", Call(Name(\"_total_length\"), Name(\"lst2\")))),\n+            Return(Name(\"lst1\")),\n+            )\n+          Return(Name(\"lst2\")),\n+          0\n+        ),\n+        parent(-1)\n+      )\n+      -1 |-> builtinsScope\n+    </scopes>\n+    <scopeLoc> 1 </scopeLoc>\n+    <heap> .Map </heap>\n+    <heapLoc> 0 </heapLoc>\n+    <stack> .List </stack>\n+    <ret> noRet </ret>\n+    <exc> NoExc </exc>\n+    <exit-code> 0 </exit-code>\n+    requires totalLen(A) >Int totalLen(B)\n+endmodule\n*** End Patch\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"019f97d6-4dc8-7d83-aae7-cebf9da1b3c7"}}}
