{"timestamp":"2026-07-25T06:00:38.001Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_03910549af0707ff016a6450ff109481959eb2e137436170df","status":"completed","call_id":"call_CmPLnXXBpijT6cxuuUhIY8I7","name":"apply_patch","input":"*** Begin Patch\n*** Update File: /workspace/verification.k\n@@\n   syntax Int ::= totalLen(ValSeq) [function, total]\n   rule totalLen(.ValSeq) => 0\n   rule totalLen(vCons(V:Val, VS:ValSeq))\n     => seqLen(V) +Int totalLen(VS)\n+\n+  // The exact final value left in a Python for-loop target.\n+  syntax Val ::= lastLoopValue(ValSeq, Val) [function, total]\n+  rule lastLoopValue(.ValSeq, OLD:Val) => OLD\n+  rule lastLoopValue(vCons(V:Val, VS:ValSeq), _OLD:Val)\n+    => lastLoopValue(VS, V)\n endmodule\n*** Update File: /workspace/spec.k\n@@\n     <scopes>\n       ...\n       L |-> scope(\n-        M:Map\n-        =>\n-        M [ \"total\" <- ACC +Int totalLen(VS) ]\n-          [ \"string\" <- ?LAST:Val ],\n-        P:Parent\n+        \"strings\" |-> ORIGINAL:Val\n+        \"total\" |-> (ACC:Int => ACC +Int totalLen(VS))\n+        \"string\" |-> (OLD:Val => lastLoopValue(VS, OLD)),\n+        parent(0)\n       )\n       ...\n@@\n     <ret> noRet </ret>\n     <exc> NoExc </exc>\n     <exit-code> 0 </exit-code>\n-    requires notBool (\"$cells\" in_keys(M))\n-     andBool \"total\" in_keys(M)\n-     andBool \"string\" in_keys(M)\n-     andBool {M[\"total\"]}:>Val ==K ACC\n \n   claim [entry-first]:\n*** End Patch\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"019f97d6-4dc8-7d83-aae7-cebf9da1b3c7"}}}
